## IPC Healing
ipc-heal-burn-none = {THE($target)} has no burn damage to repair.
ipc-heal-burn-success = You repair {THE($target)}'s burn damage with cable.
ipc-heal-burn-success-self = You repair your burn damage with cable.

ipc-heal-caustic-none = {THE($target)} has no caustic damage to repair.
ipc-heal-caustic-success = You repair {THE($target)}'s caustic damage with plastic.
ipc-heal-caustic-success-self = You repair your caustic damage with plastic.

## IPC APC Recharging
ipc-apc-recharge-already = You are already recharging.
ipc-apc-recharge-no-cell = You don't have a power cell to recharge.
ipc-apc-recharge-full = Your power cell is already full.
ipc-apc-recharge-unpowered = The APC has no power.
ipc-apc-recharge-start = You begin draining power from the APC.
ipc-apc-recharge-complete = Your power cell is fully charged.
ipc-apc-recharge-too-far = You moved too far from the APC.
ipc-apc-recharge-no-power = The APC lost power.
